      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَكْلَأُ</span></b>  (tropical:)  <i>Longer,</i> or <i>longest; more,</i> or <i>most,
protracted.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَلَغَ اللّٰهُ بِكَ أَكْلَأَ العُمُرِ</span>
(S, A) i. e. (tropical:)  [<i>May God cause thee to reach,</i> or
<i>attain,</i>] <i>the extreme,</i> or <i>most distant, period of
life!</i> (S, TA.)

